{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本 7-Eleven 超人氣「7-Café Smoothies」推出新品「深焙煎焙茶沙冰」！今次聯乘擁有逾160年歷史的京都宇治老字號茶問屋「北川半兵衛商店」，打造秋季限定特飲。這款冰沙特別挑出焙茶茶莖，並在茶葉焦化前以極高技術進行長時間深焙煎。第一口就能感受到濃郁醇厚的烘焙香氣與特有的深邃茶色，口感順滑且帶有上品回甘。品質絕對有保證！秋天去日本旅遊的朋友，記得去便利店看看！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179078405073273942_8902933786abd323308f8f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179078405217646638_9948669256abd323482519.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1790784053754676_2668252586abd32368d1a1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17907840570627701_3575496726abd323995d97.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179078405882043176_1985892786abd323b71ae9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T16:19:16.509545+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}